{"id": "EUVD-2026-97045", "enisaUuid": "46a5d26c-f710-321e-9086-39c5e123ee96", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the saveDatarule handler of SysDepartRoleController that lets low-privileged authenticated users modify department role data rules. Attackers can send crafted permissionId, roleId and dataRuleIds values to overwrite data_rule_ids, widening row-level data access or altering filtering for other department roles.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T14:33:35", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:47:58", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_depart_role_datarule_write.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/system/controller/SysDepartRoleController.java#L260-L285", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-post-sys-sysdepartrole-datarule"], "aliases": ["GHSA-w6fw-28rx-2577", "CVE-2026-108871"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "070352a7-9a3f-3af4-8d33-feefc1b76ddb", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c71fdbeb-dfd5-3af7-b7f4-4ab024510fd0", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}